<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak finmin rejects all bids for 4-wk T-bills.</title>
<headline>Slovak finmin rejects all bids for 4-wk T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak finance ministry on Wednesday rejected all bids, totalling 1.251 billion crowns, in its auction of an unspecified tranche of four-week T-bills, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of the auction were not yet available, and ministry officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
